W singular_values_of_hessians%s  singular_values_of_hessians.adb  singular_values_of_hessians.ali
W standard_coefficient_homotopy%s  standard_coefficient_homotopy.adb  standard_coefficient_homotopy.ali
W standard_complex_hessians%s  standard_complex_hessians.ads  standard_complex_hessians.ali
W standard_complex_jaco_matrices%s  standard_complex_jaco_matrices.ads  standard_complex_jaco_matrices.ali
